# (AI-assisted) snow-gpu-audit fixed views, 200 frames each
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
300 continue snow-start
301 wait *target* target-continue
302 wait *target* target-stance
303 log view snow-start
500 continue snow-flut-flut
501 wait *target* target-continue
502 wait *target* target-stance
503 log view snow-flut-flut
700 continue snow-by-ice-lake
701 wait *target* target-continue
702 wait *target* target-stance
703 log view snow-by-ice-lake
900 continue snow-outside-cave
901 wait *target* target-continue
902 wait *target* target-stance
903 log view snow-outside-cave
1100 continue snow-outside-fort
1101 wait *target* target-continue
1102 wait *target* target-stance
1103 log view snow-outside-fort
1300 continue snow-pass-to-fort
1301 wait *target* target-continue
1302 wait *target* target-stance
1303 log view snow-pass-to-fort
1500 continue snow-across-from-flut
1501 wait *target* target-continue
1502 wait *target* target-stance
1503 log view snow-across-from-flut
1700 continue snow-fort
1701 wait *target* target-continue
1702 wait *target* target-stance
1703 log view snow-fort
1900 log view end
1901 exit
